        "original_id": "4c65f920-c4d2-572c-98d3-47d4f7e3841b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Proud To Commit Commercial Suicide\n- People: Jim Jones\n- Organizations: Nailbomb, Peoples Temple\n- Events: 1995 Dynamo Open Air Festival, Jonestown aftermath\n- Places: Jonestown, northwestern Guyana\n\nFacts:\n- Proud To Commit Commercial Suicide is a live album by Nailbomb.\n- Proud To Commit Commercial Suicide captures Nailbomb's only live appearance at the 1995 Dynamo Open Air Festival.\n- The album cover of Proud To Commit Commercial Suicide shows the aftermath of Jonestown.\n- Peoples Temple was an American socialist organization led by Jim Jones.\n- Jonestown was a remote settlement established by Peoples Temple in northwestern Guyana.",
